  "title": "India-US Trade Deal and Global Economic Tensions",
  "summary": "Piyush Goyal, India's Commerce and Industry Minister, highlights the proposed trade deal between India and the US as a way to strengthen India's position in global trade while protecting sensitive interests. The deal aims to provide India with a competitive advantage over its peers, with new risks of up to 100% tariffs on Russian oil mentioned.",
  "facts": [
