      "statement": "Piyush Goyal, India's Commerce and Industry Minister, emphasized the importance of a soon-to-be concluded India-US trade agreement.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India and the US are finalising the legal text of the first tranche of their trade deal, with New Delhi seeking a competitive tariff advantage before operationalising the agreement.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India and Canada reaffirm their commitment to finalize a Bilateral Investment Treaty and conclude trade negotiations by the end of 2026.",
      "confidence": 0.95
