      "title": "US trade deal to give India strong comparative advantage, says Piyush Goyal",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/us-trade-deal-to-give-india-strong-comparative-advantage-says-piyush-goyal-126102901763_1.html",
      "description": "Commerce Minister Piyush Goyal says the proposed India-US trade agreement will protect farmers and other sensitive interests while strengthening India's position in global trade",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
